  "plain": "In 1996, in the Brazilian town of Varginha, a witness says the strange craft was seen out over the town's hospital. The documentary filmmaker James Fox, who has spent years interviewing people about the Varginha events, says he recently met this person himself. The story matters to him because the same hospital is where, by other accounts, a living creature was taken."
